VERSION 5.8 ;
DIVIDERCHAR "/" ;
BUSBITCHARS "[]" ;
DESIGN masks_special ;
UNITS DISTANCE MICRONS 1000 ;
DIEAREA ( 0 0 ) ( 2000 2000 ) ;
TRACKS Y 50 DO 20 STEP 100 LAYER M1 ;
TRACKS X 50 DO 20 STEP 100 LAYER M2 ;
TRACKS Y 100 DO 10 STEP 200 LAYER M3 ;
VIAS 1 ;
- pv12 + RECT M1 ( -25 -25 ) ( 25 25 ) + RECT V1 ( -20 -20 ) ( 20 20 ) + RECT M2 ( -25 -25 ) ( 25 25 ) ;
END VIAS
SPECIALNETS 2 ;
- VDD ( * VDD ) + USE POWER
  + ROUTED M1 50 + SHAPE FOLLOWPIN ( 0 100 ) ( 1000 100 )
  NEW M1 50 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 0 350 ) ( 2000 350 )
  NEW M1 250 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 0 550 ) ( 1000 550 )
  NEW M2 50 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 1550 0 ) ( 1550 2000 )
  NEW M3 80 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 0 1500 ) ( 1000 1500 )
  NEW M1 0 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 1550 350 ) pv12
  NEW M1 0 + SHAPE FOLLOWPIN ( 1550 100 ) pv12
  NEW M1 0 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 1550 380 ) pv12
  NEW M1 0 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 500 850 ) pv12 ;
- VSS ( * VSS ) + USE GROUND
  + ROUTED M1 50 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 0 850 ) MASK 2 ( 1000 850 )
  NEW M1 50 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 0 1950 ) MASK 2 ( 1000 1950 )
  NEW M1 50 + SHAPE STRIPE ( 1300 1000 ) ( 1300 1400 ) ;
END SPECIALNETS
END DESIGN
